What does this program print? Write the three lines separated by single spaces.

```rust
fn main() {
    let n = 7;
    println!("{n}:{}", n * n);
    println!("{}{}", 4, 2 * 5);
    println!("{:.1}", 10.0 / 4.0);
}
```

How many lines does this program print?

```rust
fn main() {
    println!("a");
    print!("b");
    print!("c");
    println!();
    println!("{}", "d\ne");
}
```
